itle-provenance"},{"id":"lat.md/sidebar-navigation#Sidebar recent sessions#Row context menu#Rename persistence#Cache mirror recovery","heading":"Cache mirror recovery","depth":4,"file":"lat.md/sidebar-navigation","filePath":"lat.md/sidebar-navigation.md","children":[],"startLine":91,"endLine":94,"firstParagraph":"If mirroring a committed rename to JSON fails, the next full metadata sync restores the durable database title even for sessions older than the incremental sync window.","githubSlug":"cache-mirror-recovery"},{"id":"lat.md/sidebar-navigation#Sidebar recent sessions#Row context menu#Rename persistence#Overlapping rename protection","heading":"Overlapping rename protection","depth":4,"file":"lat.md/sidebar-navigation","filePath":"lat.md/sidebar-navigation.md","children":[],"startLine":95,"endLine":98,"firstParagraph":"The editor prevents overlapping saves and restores editing after failures. Sidebar results from a previous profile cannot roll back a different session list.","githubSlug":"overlapping-rename-protection"}],"startLine":81,"endLine":86,"firstParagraph":"Session renames must survive `syncSessionCache`, so the durable `state.db` write happens before the JSON cache is updated.","githubSlug":"rename-persistence"}],"startLine":69,"endLine":80,"firstParagraph":"Each sidebar session row exposes a ChatGPT-style options menu — Pin, Rename, Move to project, and Delete — opened from a hover-revealed `…` button or by right-clicking the row.","githubSlug":"row-context-menu"},{"id":"lat.md/sidebar-navigation#Sidebar recent sessions#Full-list modal","heading":"Full-list modal","depth":2,"file":"lat.md/sidebar-navigation","filePath":"lat.md/sidebar-navigation.md","children":[],"startLine":99,"endLine":104,"firstParagraph":"The Cmd/Ctrl+K menu action opens an 80%×80% modal that reuses the existing Sessions screen rather than a separate route.","githubSlug":"full-list-modal"},{"id":"lat.md/sidebar-navigation#Sidebar recent sessions#Profile switch and active chat","h